upgrade:
  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: "4.3.0"
    component:
      - script: platform_core/platform/service/component/upgrade_component_power_manager.lua
        description: >
          Component power_manager_core now requires power_manager_energy_mode_impl. To satisfy the power_manager_energy_mode_impl requirement,
          power_manager_core recommends power_manager_deepsleep signifying that the lowest energy mode is EM2 or
          EM3, unless power_manager_no_deepsleep is added to the project signifying the lowest energy mode is restricted to EM1.
    configuration:
      - script: platform_core/platform/service/component/upgrade_configuration_power_manager.lua
  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: "2024.6.0"
    component:
      - trigger: device_init_emu
        description: >
          The components device_init_emu and power_manager are present in the current project. Component power_manager now
          supports initializing the Energy Management Unit (EMU). Therefore the component device_init_emu is not needed and
          will be removed from the project.
        remove:
          - device_init_emu
      - trigger: device_init_nvic
        description: >
          In simplicity_sdk 2024.6.0, the device_init_nvic component is deprecated and replaced by interrupt_manager. The device_init_nvic component will be automatically replaced by interrupt_manager in your project.
        add:
          - interrupt_manager
        remove:
          - device_init_nvic
      - trigger: ram_interrupt_vector_init
        description: >
          In simplicity_sdk 2024.6.0, the ram_interrupt_vector_init component is deprecated and replaced by interrupt_manager. The ram_interrupt_vector_init component will be automatically replaced by interrupt_manager_vector_table_in_ram in your project.
        add:
          - interrupt_manager_vector_table_in_ram
        remove:
          - ram_interrupt_vector_init
      - trigger: legacy_bootloader_interface
        description: >
          In gecko_sdk 2024.6.0, the legacy_bootloader_interface component is deprecated and replaced by bootloader_interface. The legacy_bootloader_interface component will be automatically replaced by bootloader_interface in your project.
        add:
          - bootloader_interface
        remove:
          - legacy_bootloader_interface
  - sdk:
      id: simplicity_sdk
      version: "2025.6.0"
    component:
      - script: platform_core/platform/service/component/upgrade_component_interrupt_manager.lua
        description: >
          The SL_INTERRUPT_MANAGER_S2_INTERRUPTS_IN_RAM config is deprecated and replaced by the interrupt_manager_vector_table_in_ram component.
      - script: platform_core/platform/service/component/upgrade_sl_system.lua
        description: >
          In sisdk-2025.6.0 the sl_system component was deprecated and support for baremetal applications has been removed.
          For baremetal applications sl_system_compatibility is now used for a seamless transition.
          For RTOS applications you can manually upgrade your project to sl_main or add the define SL_SUPPRESS_DEPRECATION_WARNINGS_SDK_2025_6 to your project to keep sl_system until it is removed.
          sl_system support for RTOS applications will be removed in sisdk-2026.6.0 and your project will need to upgrade to sl_main.
      - trigger: ram_interrupt_vector_init
        description: >
          In simplicity_sdk 2024.6.0, the ram_interrupt_vector_init component was deprecated and replaced by interrupt_manager. The ram_interrupt_vector_init component will be automatically replaced by interrupt_manager_vector_table_in_ram in your project.
        add:
          - interrupt_manager_vector_table_in_ram
        remove:
          - ram_interrupt_vector_init
    configuration:
      - script: platform_core/platform/service/component/upgrade_configuration_interrupt_manager.lua